PN,36501
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,FA mum whose daughter was shot dead by
OL,7,Fher father in the US has called on the
OL,8,Fprime minister and other cabinet
OL,9,Fmembers to urge authorities in Texas
OL,10,Fto reopen the case.
OL,12,FLucy Harrison, from Warrington, was
OL,13,Fkilled in January 2025 at her father's
OL,14,Fhome near Dallas, after they had
OL,15,Fargued about US President Donald Trump.
OL,17,FA grand jury in Collin County decided
OL,18,Fagainst indicting Kris Harrison, and
OL,19,Fno criminal case was brought against
OL,20,Fhim.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,FHowever, an inquest into the 23-year-
OL,7,Fold's death found that Mr Harrison had
OL,8,F"recklessly" shot his daughter in the
OL,9,Fchest while they were both in his
OL,10,Fbedroom.
OL,12,FThe court heard he had been drinking
OL,13,Fon the day he shot Lucy. He had
OL,14,Fpurportedly taken her into the room to
OL,15,Fshow her his gun.
OL,17,FSenior coroner for Cheshire Jacqueline
OL,18,FDevonish said his actions had amounted
OL,19,Fto unlawful killing on the grounds of
OL,20,Fgross negligence manslaughter.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,FSince the inquest in February, Lucy's
OL,7,Ffamily has campaigned for justice for
OL,8,Fthe fashion buyer as well as more
OL,9,Fsupport for British families dealing
OL,10,Fwith death overseas.
OL,12,FHer mum, Jane Coates, has called on
OL,13,FAndy Burnham, and Foreign Secretary Ed
OL,14,FMiliband, to put pressure on the US
OL,15,Fauthorities to re-examine the case,
OL,17,FJane wrote to both in the hope of an
OL,18,Furgent meeting with Mr Miliband to
OL,19,Fseek the aid of the foreign office in
OL,20,Fcontacting US authorities about the
OL,21,Fcase.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,FSpeaking on ITV's Good Morning Britain
OL,7,Fshe said she was determined to fight
OL,8,Ffor justice for her daughter despite
OL,9,Fthe differing legal systems between
OL,10,Fthe UK and US.
OL,12,F"Nobody believes it could happen to
OL,13,Fyou," she said. "But it has and it's
OL,14,Fmy life to bear, and it's trying to
OL,15,Fget through each day the best I can
OL,16,Ffor Lucy.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,F"But also to get justice for my
OL,7,Fdaughter because currently even though
OL,8,Fwe had an unlawful killing conclusion
OL,9,Ffrom the coroner, Lucy's father wasn't
OL,10,Fprosecuted in the US with Dallas
OL,11,FProsper Police."
OL,13,F"It was clear that the verdict Lucy's
OL,14,Fdad had given was just not possible,
OL,15,Fso we knew very very early on that
OL,16,Fthis was not the right outcome and
OL,17,Fsomething needed to be done, but we
OL,18,Fhad to follow due process," she added.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,FShe now hopes that Burnham and
OL,7,FMiliband will put pressure on those in
OL,8,FTexas to combat she believes were
OL,9,F"bias attitudes", coupled with a "poor
OL,10,Finvestigation" and gun culture within
OL,11,Fthe state, to put pressure on Texan
OL,12,Fauthorities to review the case.
OL,14,FSpeaking about her wishes, she said:
OL,15,F"I am really hoping in Andy Burnham, I
OL,16,Fdo have hope in his new government."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,FIn her letter to the government she
OL,7,Fwrote: "I understand that the British
OL,8,Fgovernment cannot interfere in the
OL,9,FAmerican justice system or direct US
OL,10,Fprosecutors to take a particular
OL,11,Fcourse of action.
OL,13,F"However, the Foreign Office can use
OL,14,Fappropriate diplomatic channels to
OL,15,Fdraw attention to the coroner's
OL,16,Fconclusion, raise the serious concerns
OL,17,Fsurrounding the original investigation
OL,18,Fand ask the relevant US authorities to
OL,19,Freview the case."
OL,26,@oD@HOUuD@AOU{D@QO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,FJane's call comes just weeks after
OL,7,FLabour MP for Warrington South, Sarah
OL,8,FHall, told an end-of-term debate in
OL,9,Fthe House of Commons that she wanted
OL,10,Fofficials and ministers to encourage
OL,11,Fauthorities in Texas to reopen or
OL,12,Freconsider Lucy's case.
OL,14,FThe MP said: "She was in her father's
OL,15,Fhome, somewhere she should have been
OL,16,Fsafe."
OL,26,@vD@NOUxD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,FSarah Hall said Lucy's family,
OL,7,Fincluding her mum and her boyfriend
OL,8,FSam Littler - who was in the house
OL,9,Fwhen she was shot - were not given
OL,10,F"adequate support" from the Foreign
OL,11,FOffice, including information on how
OL,12,Fthe Texas legal system works.
OL,14,FShe said: "The Prosper Police
OL,15,FDepartment investigated Lucy's death
OL,16,Fas a possible criminal negligent
OL,17,Fhomicide, but the case was later
OL,18,Fconsidered by a grand jury in Texas
OL,19,Fand no criminal charges were brought.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@RO]vD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,F"The gun had simply gone off. When the
OL,7,Fevidence was later examined at Lucy's
OL,8,Finquest in Cheshire, the conclusion
OL,9,Fwas very different.
OL,11,F"The senior coroner found that Lucy
OL,12,Fhad been unlawfully killed, the senior
OL,13,Fcoroner for Cheshire told the court
OL,14,Fthat Lucy's father's actions on the
OL,15,Fday of her death were truly
OL,16,Fexceptionally bad and reprehensible,
OL,17,Fso as to amount to her death, and she
OL,18,Frejected the account that the gun had
OL,19,Fsimply gone off."
OL,26,@sD@AOU{D@QO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,FShe added that Lucy's family wanted
OL,7,Fthe coroner's findings to be taken
OL,8,Fseriously and fully re-examined by the
OL,9,FUS authorities.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,FSarah Hall said: "I implore the
OL,7,FGovernment to use every channel it has
OL,8,Fto press the relevant authorities in
OL,9,FTexas to reopen or formally reconsider
OL,10,FLucy's case, and to stand alongside a
OL,11,FBritish family to ensure that the
OL,12,Ffindings of a British court are
OL,13,Fproperly considered, and as a matter
OL,14,Fof urgency to ensure the FCDO in
OL,15,Ffuture does more to support the
OL,16,Ffamilies of constituents murdered
OL,17,Fabroad."
OL,26,@nD@ROUyD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786385905
OL,3,CMP urges Government to press US to
OL,4,Creopen case after dad shoots daughter
OL,6,FCommons Leader Sir Alan Campbell
OL,7,Fpraised Sarah Hall for raising a "very
OL,8,Fmoving case", adding: "In my
OL,9,Fexperience in this place, they are
OL,10,Foften the most powerful stories, as we
OL,11,Fgive a voice to the voiceless."
OL,13,FIn June, Jane submitted a formal
OL,14,Fcomplaint to US authorities about how
OL,15,Fthe case was handled, but is yet to
OL,16,Freceive a response.
OL,26,@oD@bOUpD@LO]pD@WOUsD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/13
